SUMMARY:FREE Music Friday & Saturdays at grandview with Maya Talarico
DESCRIPTION:Join us for LIVE music every Friday & Saturday evening from 6:00 pm – 8:30 pm. Experience joy and laughter with friends over a glass of your favorite wine\, local beer or specialty cocktails. Music be held inside our warm and cozy tasting room. Fire pits are also available on the deck for outdoor seating. We are open 1:00 pm – 9:00 pm Fridays and 12:00 pm – 9:00 pm Saturdays\, so plan to arrive early as seating is first come first serve. Food is available for purchase or you may bring your own. Beverages are available for purchase until 8:30 pm. No open bottles will be sold after 8:30 pm.
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/free-music-friday-saturdays-at-grandview-2-2026-11-14/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Free-Music-FridaySaturday-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
