SUMMARY:Holiday Wreath Decorating Workshop at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Get in the holiday spirit as you sip on wine and design a fresh greens wreath for your front door!\n\n\n\n\n\n Holiday Wreath Decorating Workshop at Grandview Vineyard \nCelebrate the season with us in a cozy\, festive setting at Grandview Vineyard! In this hands-on workshop\, you’ll create your own holiday wreath using a mix of fresh evergreens\, natural accents\, and seasonal décor. Our team will guide you step by step through the decorating process and share tips to help your wreath stay beautiful all season long. \nEnjoy the warmth of the vineyard\, sip on your favorite Grandview wine\, and leave with a handmade wreath ready to add holiday charm to your home. \n*Consider arriving early or staying after the workshop to enjoy food you’ll want to order. \n\n\n\n\n\n  \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/holiday-wreath-decorating-workshop-at-grandview-2/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Holiday-Wreath-Decorating.webp
END:VEVENT
