SUMMARY:Black Friday Celebration at grandview with Ryan Moran
DESCRIPTION:Forget the Black Friday crowds! Join us for music and fun and a one stop shop for all your holiday needs!Here’s what’s going on:*Open 12-6pm with live music by TBD from 1:30-4:30pm\n*Custom Gift Boxes and Gift items available!*2027 Deck Passes for Friday OR Saturday night music are BOGO for $40. OR get an ALL ACCESS pass for Friday AND Saturdays May-Oct BOGO for ONLY $60! ($160 Value!!)*15% off any case of wine*Holiday Cheer Cocktails are BACK! Sexy Santa Mulled wine special $2 off.*ONE STOP SHOP for holiday gifts\, gift boxes\, gift cards\, gift memberships.\nSeating is first come first serve and will be available in the tasting room\, winery\, and outdoor deck (fire pits available). We will not be serving tasting flights during this event.
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/black-friday-celebration-at-grandview-2/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/BlackFriday.jpg
END:VEVENT
